{"9609": "What you get</div>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.16; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">What do I get at the end of a member survey?</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55;\">A formal findings report your leaders can act on, with a recommendation for every finding.</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; margin: 6px 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;\"><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">A survey built for your members</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">The survey instrument, written and designed for you.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">Fielding handled for you</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Programming, invitations and reminders, managed by Ricochet.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">Every response analyzed</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Each result cut by segment and reported with its margin of error.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">Recommendations you can act on</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">A findings and recommendations report, plus the full dataset.</span></div></li></ul>\n</div>\n", "9704": "What you get</div>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.16; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">What do I get from membership modeling?</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55;\">A working financial model of your association, and help carrying out the changes it points to.</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; margin: 6px 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;\"><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">A clear starting point</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">An audit of your current model, with peer and dues benchmarks.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">Options worth testing</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Member type, tier and dues options built for your association.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">A model you can work</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Change a lever and see the expected, good and poor cases side by side.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">Help making the change</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">A transformation roadmap, with Ricochet support through implementation.</span></div></li></ul>\n</div>\n", "9705": "What you get</div>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.16; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">What do I get from the Brand and Campaign Studio?</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55;\">A story your members recognize, and campaigns built on it in every format.</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; margin: 6px 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;\"><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">A story members recognize</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Messaging discovery and a value proposition, with tested concepts.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">Messages for every audience</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Messaging playbooks by audience and journey stage.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">An AI-ready design system</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Your brand codified, so every campaign stays on brand.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">Campaigns in every format</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Concepted and produced, each one reviewed by a person before launch.</span></div></li></ul>\n</div>\n", "9707": "What you get</div>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.16; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">What do I get from a tech and AI roadmap?</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55;\">A five-year plan with a decision and a cost for every system. Ricochet then builds what the roadmap calls for.</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; margin: 6px 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;\"><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">Know what you have</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">An audit of your systems and your data.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">Buy with confidence</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Requirements and RFP advice when you replace a system.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">A plan leaders can fund</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Five years of capital and operating costs, ranked by value and effort.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">Systems that work together</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Integration design, data protection and help setting up AI agents.</span></div></li></ul>\n</div>\n", "9717": "What you get</div>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.16; letter-spacing: -0.02em;\">What do I get from a fractional leader?</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55;\">A senior leader on your team for part of the week, and staff who learn the work along the way.</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style: none; margin: 6px 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;\"><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">A plan you can measure</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">A quarterly plan with priorities and measures.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">Senior leadership, part time</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Hands-on leadership, with regular reporting to your executive.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">A stronger team</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">Training for your staff, so progress continues after the engagement.</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;\"><span style=\"flex: none; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #D91A36; margin-top: 11px;\"></span><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; color: #041F33; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.25;\">AI tools your team owns</span><span style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5;\">AI tools and agents set up in your own platforms, run by your team.</span></div></li></ul>\n</div>\n"}